{"id":"vod_bf_16521","vodId":"16521","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"境界的彼方","name_cn":"境界的彼方","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/070cca2692883e1cb5611dc4a958bdd4.jpg"},"summary":"这个世界上存在着异形之物，其姿态千变万化，即为“妖梦”，以除去妖梦为业的，即为异界士。本作主人公神原秋人（KENN 配音），看起来是个普通的高二男生，实际上是由人类和妖梦结合而诞生的“半妖”。拥有不死之身的他，于某个黄昏，在校园天台遇见一名想要跳楼的少女栗山未来（种田梨纱 配音），出乎意料的是，少女居然对他发起了攻击。原来，看起来是个普通新生的眼镜美少女，竟是一名能够操纵血的异界士。　　拥有特殊能力的栗山未来，引起了异界士名门望族名濑家的注意。与秋人同为文艺部的名濑美月（茅原实里 配音）即是名濑家的次女，她嘱咐秋人远离栗山。肆虐的妖梦，孤独行走于世的异界士，以及罕有的半妖，在境界的彼方展开一个奇异的幻想故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,情,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:32:38","classic":true,"classicRank":28,"franchise":"境界的彼方","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jingjiedebifang/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:04.842Z"}